# The poses scene: each worker clip filmed on its own (one ant on the floor at a time), from the side, the front,
# above and three-quarters. Run: ./gradlew runFilm   Pictures: run-film/screenshots/poses/
# Steps: see client/FilmDirector. "views <name> <frames>" films the side view as a burst of frames, 1 tick apart.
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
ant worker_ant idle
views idle
ant worker_ant walk
views walk 10
ant worker_ant sleep
views sleep
ant worker_ant sleep_twitch
views sleep_twitch 6
ant worker_ant idle_hot
views idle_hot
ant worker_ant walk_hot
views walk_hot 7
quit
